  maxOutputCharsPerItem?: number;
  // Thread id to inspect.
  threadId: string;
  // Maximum number of turns to return.
  turnLimit?: number;
}): Promise<unknown>; };
```"},{"name":"codex_app__read_thread_terminal","description":"Tools provided by the Codex app.

